Subject: [PATCH] wasm: share encrypted restore and storage upgrade conversion

Stage unpacked files outside the persistent mirror. Rewrite attachment references alongside opaque blob names and let existing SQLite and OPFS encryption persist the result. Use the same import path for local account snapshots and retain the original until the caller verifies the reopened account.
